WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.011
Learn's operations guidance is to back
the configuration up as Graph JSON,

2
00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:09.263
weekly and before every change, and
the guide's export is that loop.

3
00:00:09.263 --> 00:00:11.024
Each read has a Learn page.

4
00:00:11.024 --> 00:00:14.862
Profiles, signaling and tagging
need Network Access Read All,

5
00:00:14.862 --> 00:00:19.225
and Global Reader or the Global Secure
Access Log Reader can read them.

6
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:23.925
Named locations and the tenant
restrictions default need Policy Read All.

7
00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:28.875
Connector groups and their members are
the surprise: Learn names only Directory

8
00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:33.013
Read Write All, delegated, so there's
no read-only permission for them.

9
00:00:33.013 --> 00:00:36.625
A connector reports active or
inactive, and its version.

10
00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:41.350
And traffic logs stay thirty days, longer
only through a diagnostic setting.
